#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QComboBox, configList)
#: rc.cpp:27 rc.cpp:1361
msgid ""
"This combo lets you either select a previously created configuration or type "
"the name of a new configuration to be created, then to be saved using the "
"save button next to it."
msgstr ""
"Binnen dit Utsöökfeld kannst Du en vördem opstellt Instellen utsöken, oder "
"den Naam för en nieg Instellen ingeven, ehr denn opstellen, un mit den Knoop "
"blangento sekern."

